Tool `Paper Search:search_pubmed` with Parameter {'query': 'belvarafenib cobimetinib melanoma trial', 'max_results': 20} on Paper Search succeeded. Result: [{"paper_id":"39199684","title":"Computational Modeling of Drug Response Identifies Mutant-Specific Constraints for Dosing panRAF and MEK Inhibitors in Melanoma.","authors":"Goetz A; Shanahan F; Brooks L; Lin E; Mroue R; Dela Cruz D; Hunsaker T; Czech B; Dixit P; Segal U; Martin S; Foster SA; Gerosa L","abstract":"This study explores the potential of pre-clinical in vitro cell line response data and computational modeling in identifying the optimal dosage requirements of pan-RAF (Belvarafenib) and MEK (Cobimetinib) inhibitors in melanoma treatment. Our research is motivated by the critical role of drug combinations in enhancing anti-cancer responses and the need to close the knowledge gap around selecting effective dosing strategies to maximize their potential.","doi":"10.3390/cancers16162914","published_date":"2024-01-01T00:00:00","pdf_url":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39199684/","source":"pubmed","updated_date":"2024-01-01T00:00:00","categories":"","keywords":"","citations":0,"references":"","extra":""},{"paper_id":"39149377","title":"Computational modeling of drug response identifies mutant-specific constraints for dosing panRAF and MEK inhibitors in melanoma.","authors":"Goetz A; Shanahan F; Brooks L; Lin E; Mroue R; Cruz DD; Hunsaker T; Czech B; Dixit P; Segal U; Martin S; Foster SA; Gerosa L","abstract":"This study explores the potential of preclinical ","doi":"10.1101/2024.08.02.606432","published_date":"2024-01-01T00:00:00","pdf_url":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39149377/","source":"pubmed","updated_date":"2024-01-01T00:00:00","categories":"","keywords":"","citations":0,"references":"","extra":""},{"paper_id":"35050937","title":"Melanoma with genetic alterations beyond the BRAFV600 mutation: management and new insights.","authors":"Awada G; Neyns B","abstract":"Molecular-targeted