  - Heavy alcohol users had higher MCV (97.8±3.8 vs 95.0±3.9; p=0.0074). Regression confirmed age (p=0.0064) and alcohol (p=0.0151) associations.
  - No significant links with sex, diabetes, non-heme/supplemental iron, MCP joint findings, TS, or SF.

- Polygenic prediction of treatment efficacy (M-Learner)
