- Precision oncology is increasingly guided by actionable biomarkers across tumor types. Tissue-agnostic approvals now include immunotherapy and targeted agents based on MSI-H/dMMR, TMB ≥10 mut/Mb, NTRK fusions, BRAF V600E, RET fusions, and HER2 IHC 3+ (ADC), decoupling therapy choice from histology/site.
