  - Extreme event: X1.9 flare on 2025-12-01 02:49Z at N23E90 (limb). ID: 2025-12-01T02:27:00-FLR-001. Source: DONKI FLR page (retrieved via NASA tools).

- Coronal Mass Ejections (CMEs; DONKI)
