  - Many NE/E-limb CMEs 2025-11-27–11-28 tied to gradual field-line opening and a NE quadrant filament eruption (DONKI CME records, e.g., 43031, 43045, 43048, 43052, 43054, 43059, etc.).

- Solar Energetic Particle (SEP) events (DONKI)
  - Cluster of SEP entries on 2025-11-10–11 associated with flares and CMEs:
    - Example: 2025-11-10 SEP events (multiple IDs at 10:24Z, 10:28Z, 10:45Z, 11:25Z, 15:04Z) linked to a flare at 08:55Z and CME at 09:36Z. One record: https://webtools.ccmc.gsfc.nasa.gov/DONKI/view/SEP/42581/-1
    - 2025-11-11 SEP entries (e.g., 09:45Z, 10:20Z, 11:09Z) linked to a 09:49Z flare and 10:23Z CME (e.g., https://webtools.ccmc.gsfc.nasa.gov/DONKI/view/SEP/42608/-1).
