- Entrance - Per Person: $20.00. On foot or bicycle, valid 1–7 days, same areas as above.
- Entrance - Motorcycle: $30.00. Valid 1–7 days; covers all riders, same areas.
- Entrance - Non-commercial Groups: $20.00 per person (for vehicles with capacity 16+), up to max comparable to commercial group caps ($100 or $200). Vehicles up to 15 passengers pay $35 per vehicle or use a pass. Exemptions: age 15 and under, valid pass holders, and hired drivers.
