- Commercial Entrance - Van: $75.00 (seating 7–15). Based on capacity, not actual passengers; passes/ages don’t affect price.
- Commercial Entrance - Mini-bus: $100.00 (seating 16–25). Same conditions as above.
- Commercial Entrance - Motor Coach: $200.00 (seating 26+). Same conditions as above.

