  - Spring: Most popular; warm, sunny; possible wildflowers.
  - Summer: Starts early; scorching by May; extremely hot.
  - Autumn: Arrives late October; warm, pleasant, generally clear.
  - Winter: Cool days, chilly nights; rare rainstorms; snow on high peaks; great low-angle light for exploration.
