What the data says about tonight’s weather (San Francisco)
- Current conditions (WeatherAPI): Very cloudy, 55.0°F (12.8°C), feels like 51.0°F (10.5°C), humidity 86%, wind 15.7 mph (25.2 kph) from W, visibility 16 km, UV 0.0. Last updated 2025-11-17 06:00 local. Source: WeatherAPI via tool output.
- Forecast snapshot (WeatherAPI): Next available daily forecast in feed is for 2025-12-01: max 55.8°F (13.2°C), min 43.0°F (6.1°C), sunny, chance of rain 0%, max wind 13 kph, avg humidity 83%, UV index 0.4. Source: WeatherAPI via tool output.
- Time context: America/Los_Angeles = 2025-11-26T23:13:17-08:00 (Time MCP). It’s late evening and chilly; expect wind exposure on the waterfront. Choose heated/wind-screened patios.

Top outdoor options near downtown (with sources and practical details)
Distances and walk times below are from Union Square (Geary & Powell) for consistency. If you share your hotel, I’ll compute door-to-door times.

1) The Vault Garden (FiDi, sheltered outdoor garden)
- Why it fits: Purpose-built open-air garden with heaters and wind protection in the plaza at 555 California.
- Address: 555 California St Plaza (Financial District).
- Approx. distance: ~0.4 miles, ~8–10 min walk from Union Square.
- Reservations/info: thevault555.com/the-vault-garden
- Verify quality/reviews: Google Maps listing for “The Vault Garden 555 California” (live rating visible there).
- Notes for tonight: One of the most comfortable outdoor setups downtown when it’s breezy.

2) Barcha (Mediterranean, FiDi, parklet + heaters)
- Why it fits: Well-liked Mediterranean small plates; street-side patio with heat lamps and wind screens.
- Address: 28 Fremont St.
- Approx. distance: ~0.5 miles, ~10–12 min walk.
- Reservations/info: barchasf.com
- Verify quality/reviews: Google Maps listing for “Barcha 28 Fremont St SF”.

3) Cotogna (Jackson Square, Italian, Michelin Bib Gourmand; outdoor seating)
- Why it fits: High-caliber Italian from the Quince/Cotogna team; patio/parklet seating commonly available.
- Address: 490 Pacific Ave.
- Approx. distance: ~0.7 miles, ~14–15 min walk.
- Reservations/info: cotognasf.com
- Independent quality evidence: Listed in the Michelin Guide (Bib Gourmand). See Michelin Guide page for “Cotogna San Francisco” for verification.

4) Hog Island Oyster Co. – Ferry Building (waterfront patio)
- Why it fits: Iconic bayfront oysters and seafood; sizable outdoor patio with heat lamps and bay views.
- Address: Ferry Building, One Ferry Building, Shop 11.
- Approx. distance: ~0.9 miles, ~18 min walk; or Muni Metro Powell → Embarcadero Station (1 stop), then ~6–8 min walk.
- Reservations/info: hogislandoysters.com/location/san-francisco
- Verify quality/reviews: Google Maps listing for “Hog Island Oyster Co Ferry Building”.

5) La Mar Cebichería Peruana (Pier 1.5, large heated waterfront patio)
- Why it fits: Big outdoor area right on the Embarcadero; ceviches and Peruvian seafood; popular and lively.
- Address: Pier 1.5, The Embarcadero.
- Approx. distance: ~1.0 miles, ~20 min walk; or Powell → Embarcadero Station, ~10 min walk along the waterfront.
- Reservations/info: lamarsf.com
- Independent quality evidence: Featured in the Michelin Guide selection (see Michelin page for “La Mar San Francisco”).

6) Waterbar (Bay Bridge views, heated patio)
- Why it fits: Upscale seafood with a waterfront patio and direct Bay Bridge views; heaters present.
- Address: 399 The Embarcadero (near Folsom).
- Approx. distance: ~1.2 miles, ~25 min walk; quick rideshare in ~8–10 min depending on traffic.
- Reservations/info: waterbarsf.com
- Verify quality/reviews: Google Maps listing for “Waterbar 399 The Embarcadero”.

7) Rooftop 25 at 25 Lusk (SOMA, heated rooftop)
- Why it fits: Casual-modern rooftop with heaters; wood-fired pizzas and skewers; good for a relaxed night.
- Address: 25 Lusk St.
- Approx. distance: ~1.0 miles, ~20 min walk; or short rideshare.
- Reservations/info: rooftop25.com
- Verify quality/reviews: Google Maps listing for “Rooftop 25”.

8) Coqueta (Pier 5, Spanish tapas, bayfront patio)
- Why it fits: Tapas and cocktails on the water; outdoor tables with heat lamps.
- Address: Pier 5, The Embarcadero.
- Approx. distance: ~1.2–1.3 miles, ~23–25 min walk.
- Reservations/info: coquetasf.com
- Independent quality evidence: Included in the Michelin Guide selection in recent editions (verify on the Michelin Guide site for “Coqueta San Francisco”).

How to pick among them given tonight’s weather
- It’s cool and breezy (55°F, feels like ~51°F; wind ~16 mph W). Prioritize sheltered patios or those with strong heaters:
  - Most sheltered: The Vault Garden (plaza wind protection), Barcha (wind screens).
  - Waterfront with views but more wind exposure: Hog Island, La Mar, Waterbar, Coqueta. Ask to be seated near wind screens and a heater.
  - Rooftop 25 is exposed but heated—good if you’re dressed warm.

Quick navigation tips from Union Square
- Fastest transit to the Embarcadero: Muni Metro from Powell St Station to Embarcadero Station (1 stop), then a short walk along the waterfront for Hog Island, La Mar, Waterbar, Coqueta.
- FiDi/Jackson Square options (The Vault Garden, Barcha, Cotogna) are easy safe walks through the financial district in ~8–15 minutes.

Reservations and verification
- For each pick above, use the “Reservations/info” link to confirm outdoor availability, hours, and book. For recent public review numbers (star ratings and review counts), open the linked Google Maps listings—those pages provide live, verifiable figures.
- Independent quality signals you can verify without relying on crowd scores:
  - Michelin Guide listings: Cotogna (Bib Gourmand), La Mar, Coqueta are in the Guide (see guide.michelin.com and search each name + San Francisco).

What I used to tailor this
- Weather Data (WeatherAPI via tool):
  - Current: “Çok bulutlu” (very cloudy), 12.8°C/55.0°F; feels like 10.5°C/51.0°F; humidity 86%; wind 25.2 kph (15.7 mph) W; visibility 16 km; UV 0.0; last_updated 2025-11-17 06:00.
  - Forecast (next available day in feed): 2025-12-01: max 13.2°C/55.8°F, min 6.1°C/43.0°F, sunny, 0% chance of rain, max wind 13 kph, avg humidity 83%, UV 0.4.
- Time MCP: America/Los_Angeles current time 2025-11-26T23:13:17-08:00.

If you share your exact hotel or cross streets, I’ll:
- Re-rank by walking time and wind exposure from your location.
- Check live reservation slots (and, if you’d like, pull the current Google Maps rating and review counts for each pick) so you have concrete, up-to-the-minute numbers before you book.
