- Invertible matrix and the Invertible Matrix Theorem (equivalences: det≠0 ⇔ invertible ⇔ full rank): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invertible_matrix#The_invertible_matrix_theorem
- Rank (rank < n implies singular): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rank_(linear_algebra)
- SVD and rank (zero singular value indicates rank deficiency): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Singular_value_decomposition

