training large Transformers, but is severely hindered by ex-
treme activation outliers. Existing solutions either rely on
complex mixed-precision engineering or invasive architec-
tural modifications. This paper fundamentally challenges
the conventional wisdom that outliers are data-driven. We
demonstrate that extreme outliers are adata-independent,
