- Data: 657 images, 33,027 multiple-choice questions (avg 50.3 Qs/image)
  - Natural: 10,445 Qs; 6/22 categories; 158 images
  - Document: 7,422 Qs; 6/15; 178 images
  - E-commerce: 5,886 Qs; 7/16; 121 images
  - Embodied AI: 9,274 Qs; 6/16; 200 images

Task and evaluation
