  - Generators: GPT-5, GPT-4o, o4-mini.
  - Keep taxonomy linkage for per-category diagnostics.
- Filtering text-answerable questions:
  - Blind text-only tests with Qwen2.5-72B, 10 runs with shuffled options; discard if accuracy exceeds a threshold above chance.
- Deduplication:
