- Quality control and human verification:
  - Dual VLM validation (GPT-5, Gemini 2.5 Pro) with meta-flags (AMBIGUOUS, UNANSWERABLE FROM IMAGE, NOT SUITABLE FOR CAPTION EVAL, NONE OF THE ABOVE).
  - Keep only when both pick the same correct option; otherwise route to human refinement.
  - >90% reduction in human review burden.
